---
/**
 * A side remark, shown as a muted note in the text column at every width.
 * Section pages lay their blocks out on a grid (.flow), which ignores floats, so a
 * margin note would need a margin column that the grid does not have.
 * <Aside>Short remark.</Aside>
 */
---

<aside class="margin-note ui"><slot /></aside>

<style>
  .margin-note {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--rule-strong);
    padding: var(--s-1) 0 var(--s-1) var(--s-3);
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-4);
  }
  .margin-note :global(p) {
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-2);
  }
</style>
